---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout title="Volunteer">
  <div class="py-8">
  <div class="mb-6 space-y-2">
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-6xl tracking-tight">Volunteer</h1>
    <h2 class="text-lg md:text-3xl font-light text-gray-700">Get involved and make a difference in your community.</h2>
  </div>
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4 md:gap-8 lg:gap-12 xl:gap-16">
      <div class="flex-grow max-w-5xl">
        <div class="w-full mb-8">
  <img src="/img/volunteer_banner.jpg" alt="Volunteer" class="w-full h-auto rounded-lg">
</div>

<section class="section space-y-4">
  <h3 class="heading">Enable Change with Your Skills!</h3>
  <p>
    For more then a decade, Code for Pakistan has been at the forefront of driving positive change across the country, thanks to the
    unwavering support of our vibrant community. We are united in our belief that collective action, creative hacking, and innovative problem-solving can open
    doors to endless opportunities for making a difference.
  </p>
  <p>
    As a leading civic-tech nonprofit, we harness the power of technology, design, and passionate community
    engagement to tackle the most pressing challenges facing our society. Our mission is to empower technologists,
    designers, community leaders, and anyone enthusiastic about making a positive impact to come together and
    develop innovative solutions that benefit our community.
  </p>
</section>

<!-- Call to Action -->
<!-- include components/cta.html removed -->

<section class="section space-y-4 border-s-8 border-emerald-500 ps-8 bg-emerald-100">
  <h3 class="heading">Why Volunteer with Code for Pakistan?</h3>
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
    <div>
      <h4 class="heading">Make an impact</h4>
      <p>
        Use your skills to create solutions that address real-world challenges faced by Pakistani communities.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h4 class="heading">Learn and grow</h4>
      <p>Enhance your expertise by collaborating with like-minded individuals from diverse backgrounds.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h4 class="heading">Build your network</h4>
      <p>Forge lasting connections with professionals, government officials, and community stakeholders.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h4 class="heading">Enjoy giving back</h4>
      <p>Contribute your time and talent to make a difference in the lives of those who need it most.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section space-y-4">
  <h3 class="heading">Everybody is Welcome!</h3>
  <p>
    Whether you're a seasoned professional with years of experience or just starting out, we have a place for
    you in our community. Our volunteer circle includes people from all sorts of backgrounds like software
    developers, data analysts, UX/UI designers, photographers, researchers, writers, and others.
  </p>
  <p>
    At Code for Pakistan, we believe that diverse perspectives foster innovation and lead to more effective
    problem-solving. As a volunteer, you will have the opportunity to collaborate with us on a wide range of
    projects, such as developing mobile applications, creating data visualizations, conducting research, and
    much more.
  </p>
  <p>
    Our projects span various sectors, including education, healthcare, public safety, environmental
    sustainability, and urban development. No matter what your passion is, you can find a project that matches
    your interests and empowers you to make a meaningful difference.
  </p>
</section>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</MainLayout>

